WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.000 --> 00:12.000
"Echo Of A Letter" (Episode 9)

3
00:26.320 --> 00:27.360
Mr. Zhao.

4
00:27.440 --> 00:28.639
Are you feeling alright?

5
00:28.719 --> 00:29.719
Your face is so flushed.

6
00:31.320 --> 00:32.320
I'm fine.

7
00:33.399 --> 00:34.399
Glad to hear it.

8
00:35.039 --> 00:36.039
Let's go.

9
00:40.640 --> 00:42.039
Zhao Shengge...

10
00:42.119 --> 00:43.280
carries my scent on him.

11
00:45.600 --> 00:46.760
Shen Zongnian,

12
00:46.840 --> 00:48.840
when are you going to get a Christmas tree for me?

13
00:49.439 --> 00:50.439
Don't know how.

14
00:51.600 --> 00:53.359
Zhao Shengge has all the luck,

15
00:53.439 --> 00:55.280
having someone get a Christmas tree for him.

16
00:57.359 --> 00:58.679
Hey, Shengge.

17
00:58.759 --> 01:00.200
You got this car modded, right?

18
01:00.280 --> 01:01.399
What's the top speed?

19
01:01.479 --> 01:02.800
Hard to say.

20
01:02.880 --> 01:04.279
The faster it goes,

21
01:04.359 --> 01:05.439
and the higher the chassis,

22
01:06.120 --> 01:08.319
the more trash cans you can knock over.

23
01:08.920 --> 01:09.560
Come on!

24
01:09.640 --> 01:10.040
I...

25
01:10.120 --> 01:12.200
I only hit a trash can that one time!

26
01:12.280 --> 01:13.280
Catch.

27
01:14.439 --> 01:15.439
Thanks, boss!

28
01:15.519 --> 01:16.799
Drive safe.

29
01:16.879 --> 01:17.799
Shen Zongnian,

30
01:17.879 --> 01:18.999
did I hear that right?

31
01:19.079 --> 01:20.959
Zhao Shengge actually cares about me!

32
01:25.599 --> 01:26.775
Wait, if you give him your car,

33
01:26.799 --> 01:27.799
how are you getting back?

34
01:28.480 --> 01:30.079
Mr. Zhao, if you don't mind,

35
01:30.159 --> 01:31.480
you can ride back with me.

36
01:32.319 --> 01:33.480
If it's any trouble,

37
01:33.560 --> 01:34.656
I can always catch a ride with Jiang Ying.

38
01:34.680 --> 01:35.760
It's no trouble at all.

39
01:36.560 --> 01:37.560
Right this way.

40
01:38.200 --> 01:39.480
Shen Zongnian, hurry and get in!

41
01:40.439 --> 01:41.560
Zongnian,

42
01:41.640 --> 01:42.775
with you keeping an eye on him,

43
01:42.799 --> 01:43.799
he'll be fine.

44
01:53.040 --> 01:54.295
Mr. Zhao, why don't you take the back?

45
01:54.319 --> 01:55.319
There's more legroom.

46
01:57.120 --> 01:58.280
I'll take the passenger seat.

47
01:58.359 --> 01:59.359
The view is better.

48
01:59.879 --> 02:00.879
Alright.

49
02:14.039 --> 02:15.039
Mr. Zhao,

50
02:16.080 --> 02:17.080
let me get that for you.

51
02:58.800 --> 02:59.800
Chen Wan,

52
03:01.879 --> 03:03.599
where should I put this lipstick of yours?

53
03:04.599 --> 03:05.599
It's my mom's.

54
03:07.520 --> 03:08.880
Chen Wan,

55
03:08.960 --> 03:10.240
I asked where to put it.

56
03:12.319 --> 03:13.040
I'm sorry.

57
03:13.120 --> 03:14.120
I misheard you.

58
03:14.759 --> 03:16.960
You can just put it in the glove box.

59
03:26.800 --> 03:27.559
Mr. Zhao,

60
03:27.639 --> 03:29.799
feel free to change the radio station right here.

61
03:29.879 --> 03:30.240
Okay.

62
03:30.879 --> 03:32.079
Up to you.

63
03:32.159 --> 03:33.159
By the way, Chen Wan,

64
03:35.439 --> 03:36.639
can I run something by you?

65
03:37.840 --> 03:38.840
What is it?

66
03:40.639 --> 03:42.000
I rarely get days off.

67
03:42.080 --> 03:43.280
When you keep calling me that,

68
03:43.319 --> 03:45.119
it makes me feel like I'm still on the clock.

69
03:47.039 --> 03:48.639
Then what should I call you?

70
03:49.439 --> 03:50.880
If you don't mind,

71
03:50.960 --> 03:52.399
just call me by my name.

72
03:52.479 --> 03:53.879
Let's drop the formalities.

73
03:54.639 --> 03:55.200
Youming,

74
03:55.280 --> 03:56.119
and Zongnian,

75
03:56.199 --> 03:57.280
that's what they call me.

76
03:59.080 --> 04:00.080
Okay.

77
04:04.759 --> 04:05.280
Sure.

78
04:05.360 --> 04:06.679
Let's go.

79
04:06.759 --> 04:07.759
Got it,

80
04:08.319 --> 04:08.920
Zhao.

81
04:09.000 --> 04:09.559
Sheng-

82
04:09.639 --> 04:10.639
ge.

83
04:39.600 --> 04:40.600
The AC.

84
04:45.279 --> 04:46.960
Mr. Zhao, sit here.

85
04:47.040 --> 04:48.040
It's out of the draft.

86
04:53.759 --> 04:54.600
Shengge,

87
04:54.680 --> 04:56.000
living like a king today, huh?

88
04:59.480 --> 05:01.136
Everyone, see if there's anything you want to add.

89
05:01.160 --> 05:02.920
We don't come to this restaurant very often.

90
05:06.439 --> 05:07.319
Wan,

91
05:07.399 --> 05:08.399
you order for us.

92
05:12.920 --> 05:13.920
Mr. Zhao,

93
05:14.000 --> 05:14.879
take a look at the menu

94
05:14.959 --> 05:16.399
and see what you're in the mood for.

95
05:16.879 --> 05:18.199
Address me properly,

96
05:18.279 --> 05:19.279
or I won't answer.

97
05:21.040 --> 05:22.776
There are too many people around. It's not appropriate.

98
05:22.800 --> 05:23.800
Next time.

99
05:23.879 --> 05:25.199
Names are meant to be used.

100
05:26.639 --> 05:28.800
Well, you have to give me some time to get used to it.

101
05:30.040 --> 05:31.040
OK.

102
05:31.959 --> 05:32.759
Hey!

103
05:32.839 --> 05:34.759
Are you two ever going to order?

104
05:34.839 --> 05:37.319
I'm exhausted and I've been starving all day!

105
05:37.920 --> 05:39.480
You can order on your phone, too.

106
05:39.560 --> 05:40.960
Just scan it and look for yourself.

107
05:41.720 --> 05:42.319
Nian,

108
05:42.399 --> 05:42.999
stop working.

109
05:43.079 --> 05:44.439
Hand me your phone so I can order.

110
05:47.199 --> 05:48.599
Steamed fish with black bean sauce,

111
05:49.399 --> 05:50.799
and an order of steamed rice cakes.

112
05:51.360 --> 05:51.999
The steamed rice cakes...

113
05:52.079 --> 05:53.696
Would you still like to keep that on the order?

114
05:53.720 --> 05:54.720
Yes.

115
05:55.319 --> 05:57.360
I just never realized I liked them before.

116
05:59.800 --> 06:02.119
Do you prefer them sweeter or milder?

117
06:02.199 --> 06:04.119
With osmanthus?

118
06:04.199 --> 06:05.400
Let's try both.

119
06:05.480 --> 06:06.480
Sure.

120
06:17.759 --> 06:18.999
Shengge,

121
06:19.079 --> 06:20.976
things have been pretty rough on Ting Island lately.

122
06:21.000 --> 06:22.000
I'm thinking,

123
06:22.680 --> 06:23.935
for the Lychee Bowl Phase Two project,

124
06:23.959 --> 06:25.199
maybe we should put it on hold?

125
06:25.600 --> 06:26.600
That's not how I see it.

126
06:27.399 --> 06:28.799
If we delay the site inspection,

127
06:28.879 --> 06:30.600
a massive amount of cash flow gets tied up,

128
06:30.680 --> 06:32.799
multiplying the leverage.

129
06:32.879 --> 06:33.879
The risk is too high.

130
06:35.000 --> 06:36.360
Then you'd better bring extra men.

131
06:37.000 --> 06:38.319
After Mak Ka Fai went down,

132
06:38.399 --> 06:39.976
Li Jiaming took some of his crew back there.

133
06:40.000 --> 06:42.759
Word is, Li Jiaming's old turf was right in Lychee Bowl.

134
06:43.639 --> 06:44.839
I know what I'm doing.

135
06:45.519 --> 06:46.519
But...

136
06:51.199 --> 06:51.879
Alright, drop it.

137
06:51.959 --> 06:52.959
Let's eat.

138
06:53.839 --> 06:54.600
Shengge,

139
06:54.680 --> 06:55.999
bring more backup when you go.

140
06:56.079 --> 06:57.079
Watch your back.

141
07:04.240 --> 07:05.240
What was that for?

142
07:09.720 --> 07:10.720
It's fine. Go ahead.

143
07:11.759 --> 07:12.879
I want to go to Ting Island.

144
07:14.879 --> 07:16.280
Looking for a getaway?

145
07:16.360 --> 07:17.600
We can all

146
07:17.680 --> 07:19.160
take a trip to Feiling Island later.

147
07:20.040 --> 07:21.519
I'll be back before you know it.

148
07:22.040 --> 07:23.295
We'll call it a team-building retreat.

149
07:23.319 --> 07:24.319
No,

150
07:24.360 --> 07:25.360
I'm not going for fun.

151
07:25.879 --> 07:28.240
I want to go to Ting Island with you.

152
07:28.800 --> 07:29.319
Why?

153
07:29.399 --> 07:31.319
I need to calculate the tidal energy conversion

154
07:31.399 --> 07:33.239
and finalize the transfer equation parameters.

155
07:33.279 --> 07:34.495
Dr. Fang has plenty of students

156
07:34.519 --> 07:35.840
who can run those tests.

157
07:35.920 --> 07:37.680
True, but our specializations are different.

158
07:37.720 --> 07:40.240
Otherwise, you wouldn't be paying two separate teams, Mr. Zhao.

159
07:43.720 --> 07:44.720
I can pay my own way.

160
07:47.079 --> 07:48.439
Chen Wan.

161
07:48.519 --> 07:49.519
Zhao Shengge,

162
07:52.279 --> 07:53.960
I'd be worried sick.

163
07:54.040 --> 07:55.040
I want to go.

164
08:02.879 --> 08:04.960
Though if I'll really just be in the way...

165
08:05.040 --> 08:06.200
Do you know how to use a gun?

166
08:07.439 --> 08:08.439
I do.

167
08:10.319 --> 08:11.999
Once we're there, you do everything I say.

168
08:13.199 --> 08:14.199
Every word.

169
08:16.360 --> 08:17.360
Eat your food.

170
08:20.519 --> 08:21.080
What are you two

171
08:21.160 --> 08:22.280
whispering about over there?

172
08:27.160 --> 08:28.160
Waiter,

173
08:33.759 --> 08:34.919
could I get a new spoon?

174
08:35.639 --> 08:37.559
This one seems a little bent.

175
08:38.320 --> 08:39.320
Right away, sir.

176
08:56.679 --> 08:57.679
Second Boss,

177
08:58.240 --> 08:59.760
that traitor Li Jiaming—

178
08:59.840 --> 09:01.320
he's joined forces with Zhao Shengge.

179
09:02.279 --> 09:03.199
My informant says.

180
09:03.279 --> 09:04.456
Zhao Shengge is heading to Ting Island

181
09:04.480 --> 09:06.040
to survey the data at Lychee Bowl.

182
09:06.120 --> 09:07.760
A scientific survey? Please.

183
09:07.840 --> 09:09.519
It's just a cover to meet up with him.

184
09:10.759 --> 09:12.319
If they team up,

185
09:12.399 --> 09:13.479
what are we supposed to do?

186
09:14.879 --> 09:16.080
This might just be

187
09:16.720 --> 09:17.799
the break we need.

188
09:18.879 --> 09:19.879
A break?

189
09:23.799 --> 09:26.760
I know Zhao Shengge is the crown prince of Haishi,

190
09:26.840 --> 09:28.240
but nobody ever said

191
09:28.320 --> 09:29.960
he runs things on Ting Island.

192
09:33.279 --> 09:34.679
Brilliant as always, Second Boss—.

193
09:36.919 --> 09:38.200
I mean, Boss!

194
09:47.879 --> 09:48.360
Thank you.

195
09:48.440 --> 09:49.360
My pleasure.

196
09:49.440 --> 09:50.479
Give it a try. How is it?

197
09:50.559 --> 09:51.559
Okay.

198
09:56.559 --> 09:57.760
Not bad.

199
09:57.840 --> 10:00.240
Though I usually take mine a notch less sweet.

200
10:00.759 --> 10:01.959
Viola, make a note of that.

201
10:02.039 --> 10:03.360
Keep Lucas in the loop, too.

202
10:04.440 --> 10:05.440
What?

203
10:05.480 --> 10:07.679
You'll be coming to Minglong a lot in the future.

204
10:10.759 --> 10:11.759
Thank you.

205
10:13.919 --> 10:14.919
What about food?

206
10:15.960 --> 10:18.240
What do you usually like to eat?

207
10:19.279 --> 10:21.240
I prefer Cantonese cuisine.

208
10:21.840 --> 10:23.599
Though my mother is from Gusu.

209
10:23.679 --> 10:25.360
So I'm also used to Jiangzhe flavors.

210
10:26.480 --> 10:27.840
Then what about you, Zhao Shengge?

211
10:28.879 --> 10:30.120
What kind of food do you like?

212
10:32.600 --> 10:33.600
Don't you already know?

213
10:36.240 --> 10:37.440
I don't.

214
10:39.200 --> 10:40.440
I like home-cooked meals.

215
10:41.159 --> 10:42.319
Just the most ordinary kind.

216
10:42.399 --> 10:43.160
Okay.

217
10:43.240 --> 10:44.320
I'll keep that in mind too.

218
10:58.000 --> 10:59.000
Chen Wan.

219
11:08.279 --> 11:09.599
Take this.

220
11:09.679 --> 11:10.679
For me?

221
11:12.399 --> 11:13.959
You know how to use a gun, right?

222
11:14.039 --> 11:16.039
I saw your shooting stance. Your form is solid.

223
11:17.480 --> 11:18.400
I rarely practice.

224
11:18.480 --> 11:19.840
Don't get many chances to use one.

225
11:20.519 --> 11:21.439
If it comes down to it,

226
11:21.519 --> 11:22.519
just shoot.

227
11:24.159 --> 11:25.400
Thank you, Zhao Shengge.

228
11:25.480 --> 11:27.040
Later, when you have some free time,

229
11:27.120 --> 11:28.920
I'll have someone come measure your grip

230
11:29.000 --> 11:30.120
and custom-make one for you.

231
11:32.679 --> 11:33.479
In the future,

232
11:33.559 --> 11:35.319
you'll likely be traveling far for business,

233
11:35.559 --> 11:36.919
especially overseas.

234
11:37.440 --> 11:38.760
Having a gun that fits your hand

235
11:38.840 --> 11:39.840
is vital.

236
11:44.799 --> 11:45.799
No need.

237
11:46.679 --> 11:48.119
This one is more than enough for me.

238
11:49.159 --> 11:50.159
You have a good eye.

239
11:57.320 --> 11:58.320
Dr. Fang.

240
11:59.320 --> 12:00.639
You guys are here so early.

241
12:01.279 --> 12:02.439
Sorry about that, Miss Xu.

242
12:02.519 --> 12:03.519
Kept you waiting so long.

243
12:05.600 --> 12:06.319
Chen Wan.

244
12:06.399 --> 12:07.456
This is the latest engineering blueprint

245
12:07.480 --> 12:09.679
I pulled an all-nighter to finish.

246
12:09.759 --> 12:10.759
Here, take a look.

247
12:11.559 --> 12:12.559
Okay, let me see.

248
12:13.639 --> 12:14.976
How are the arrangements coming along?

249
12:15.000 --> 12:15.640
Look.

250
12:15.720 --> 12:17.479
This is our current layout plan.

251
12:17.559 --> 12:18.360
Yes.

252
12:18.440 --> 12:19.640
That's right.

253
12:19.720 --> 12:20.720
Dr. Fang,

254
12:20.799 --> 12:22.120
send a copy to my phone.

255
12:22.200 --> 12:23.520
We can discuss it over the phone.

256
12:23.919 --> 12:24.959
Here, hold this.

257
12:25.039 --> 12:25.520
Watch out for the sun.

258
12:25.600 --> 12:27.000
Sure.

259
12:27.080 --> 12:29.559
The research vessel crew has been strictly vetted.

260
12:29.639 --> 12:30.639
The bodyguards too.

261
12:36.200 --> 12:36.760
Excuse me.

262
12:36.840 --> 12:37.679
He's with us.

263
12:37.759 --> 12:38.759
Go on.

264
12:39.279 --> 12:40.615
The bodyguards will also follow in a yacht,

265
12:40.639 --> 12:41.639
staying ten meters away

266
12:41.679 --> 12:43.439
so they don't disrupt everyone's daily work.

267
12:43.519 --> 12:45.240
Good. Get back to your work.

268
12:45.320 --> 12:46.679
Okay, I'll go get ready.

269
12:49.840 --> 12:50.840
Mr. Zhao.

270
12:54.600 --> 12:55.439
Miss Xu.

271
12:55.519 --> 12:56.920
I'll leave you two to talk.

272
12:57.000 --> 12:58.000
No need.

273
12:58.679 --> 12:59.679
Go ahead.

274
13:00.720 --> 13:02.240
Aren't you afraid of Li Jiaming?

275
13:02.320 --> 13:04.079
Lai Chi Wun is his turf.

276
13:04.159 --> 13:06.799
You swooped in and took his cash cow of over a decade,

277
13:06.879 --> 13:08.495
and now you're walking right into his den?

278
13:08.519 --> 13:10.079
Money talks.

279
13:10.159 --> 13:13.279
Especially to an old syndicate enforcer who's been around the block.

280
13:14.279 --> 13:15.279
Just with this?

281
13:15.840 --> 13:16.920
The enemy of my enemy

282
13:17.000 --> 13:18.479
can be a friend.

283
13:18.559 --> 13:20.000
You want to back Li Jiaming

284
13:20.080 --> 13:21.855
and watch the White Crane Syndicate tear itself apart?

285
13:21.879 --> 13:23.880
That depends on the choice he makes.

286
13:23.960 --> 13:25.176
Which wife's son does he favor the most?

287
13:25.200 --> 13:26.760
His sons are all in Haishi.

288
13:26.840 --> 13:28.679
He also secretly runs a private bank

289
13:28.759 --> 13:29.759
on the black market.

290
13:29.799 --> 13:31.399
Taking him down won't be hard.

291
13:32.720 --> 13:34.559
A private bank?

292
13:34.639 --> 13:35.520
Then I

293
13:35.600 --> 13:36.920
can pitch in a little.

294
13:37.000 --> 13:38.319
Much appreciated.

295
13:38.399 --> 13:39.199
Don't mention it.

296
13:39.279 --> 13:40.559
We're partners, after all.

297
13:40.639 --> 13:41.120
Safe travels.

298
13:41.200 --> 13:42.200
Thanks.

299
14:05.399 --> 14:06.855
This humble place is a bit rough around the edges.

300
14:06.879 --> 14:08.920
Nothing like the mansions you're used to.

301
14:09.000 --> 14:10.000
Hope you don't mind.

302
14:10.039 --> 14:11.559
You're too modest, Boss Li.

303
14:11.639 --> 14:12.639
Come.

304
14:13.159 --> 14:14.040
Gentlemen,

305
14:14.120 --> 14:16.719
our boss has arranged accommodations for everyone.

306
14:16.799 --> 14:17.799
Please follow us.

307
14:19.600 --> 14:20.640
Mr. Zhao,

308
14:20.720 --> 14:21.479
in the tearoom,

309
14:21.559 --> 14:23.255
I have some rare tea you won't find anywhere else.

310
14:23.279 --> 14:24.079
Let's go have a taste.

311
14:24.159 --> 14:26.240
Sir, please follow me to your room to rest.

312
14:27.600 --> 14:28.600
Zhao Shengge.

313
14:31.840 --> 14:32.920
You head back first.

314
14:33.000 --> 14:34.000
It's fine.

315
14:34.679 --> 14:35.280
Sir.

316
14:35.360 --> 14:36.360
This way.

317
14:37.240 --> 14:38.240
Please.

318
14:46.600 --> 14:47.600
Come.

319
14:48.200 --> 14:49.079
Mr. Zhao,

320
14:49.159 --> 14:51.719
I heard your terms loud and clear,

321
14:51.799 --> 14:54.679
but you're asking for too much.

322
14:57.039 --> 14:58.640
After Mak Ka Fai goes down,

323
14:58.720 --> 15:02.240
you should know very well how much I take.

324
15:02.320 --> 15:04.240
So you're haggling with me?

325
15:06.679 --> 15:08.039
I wouldn't dare.

326
15:21.039 --> 15:22.160
Mr. Zhao,

327
15:22.240 --> 15:24.000
you brought quite a crowd this time.

328
15:24.759 --> 15:25.840
Standard security.

329
15:26.759 --> 15:28.040
Mr. Chen

330
15:28.120 --> 15:29.416
has been standing right over there.

331
15:29.440 --> 15:31.040
Ever since you walked in,

332
15:31.120 --> 15:32.839
he's been right there.

333
15:32.919 --> 15:34.639
Hasn't strayed a single step.

334
15:36.759 --> 15:37.759
Seems like

335
15:39.080 --> 15:40.559
the people around you

336
15:41.320 --> 15:43.200
care about you a great deal.

337
15:53.320 --> 15:54.599
Don't joke around.

338
15:54.679 --> 15:55.520
Mr. Zhao,

339
15:55.600 --> 15:57.319
the terms you just mentioned,

340
15:57.399 --> 15:58.880
I can agree to them.

341
15:58.960 --> 15:59.599
However,

342
15:59.679 --> 16:01.240
I have terms of my own.

343
16:01.320 --> 16:02.679
That project in Lai Chi Wun,

344
16:02.759 --> 16:04.319
leave me a piece of the pie.

345
16:04.399 --> 16:07.919
Just enough for my boys to make a living.

346
16:19.919 --> 16:20.919
Thank you, thank you.

347
16:26.159 --> 16:27.159
Please.

348
16:32.240 --> 16:33.240
Mr. Chen.

349
16:33.879 --> 16:34.879
Mr. Chen,

350
16:36.120 --> 16:37.880
are you waiting for Mr. Zhao here?

351
16:37.960 --> 16:39.000
No.

352
16:39.080 --> 16:39.799
I just came to admire

353
16:39.879 --> 16:41.960
and take a tour of your backyard, Mr. Li.

354
16:43.759 --> 16:44.439
Mr. Chen,

355
16:44.519 --> 16:47.520
you looked familiar when I saw you at noon.

356
16:47.600 --> 16:49.399
Have we met before?

357
16:52.000 --> 16:54.400
If you go to Haishi often, Mr. Li,

358
16:54.480 --> 16:56.000
it's only natural we've crossed paths.

359
16:56.720 --> 16:58.000
Let's head back inside.

360
16:58.080 --> 16:59.280
The sun's too strong out here.

361
17:00.639 --> 17:01.639
Okay.

362
17:03.159 --> 17:04.159
Mr. Zhao,

363
17:04.200 --> 17:05.479
what's the plan for tomorrow?

364
17:05.559 --> 17:07.719
We're heading out to sea tomorrow for seabed testing.

365
17:07.799 --> 17:09.840
However, our research vessel isn't in position yet.

366
17:09.920 --> 17:11.295
I might have to trouble you to make arrangements.

367
17:11.319 --> 17:11.920
Don't worry.

368
17:12.000 --> 17:14.255
I'll have everything set up for you first thing tomorrow.

369
17:14.279 --> 17:15.199
We'll take our leave then.

370
17:15.279 --> 17:16.279
Thank you.

371
17:19.279 --> 17:19.999
Mr. Zhao,

372
17:20.079 --> 17:21.160
did the talks go well?

373
17:21.240 --> 17:22.999
Are the seabed test results in?

374
17:23.079 --> 17:24.759
We're still sorting through the data.

375
17:24.839 --> 17:26.679
I'll have it compiled by tonight.

376
17:26.759 --> 17:28.320
Based on the actual findings,

377
17:28.400 --> 17:30.360
the geological conditions in these waters

378
17:30.440 --> 17:31.440
are ideal.

379
17:32.000 --> 17:33.199
If we cut through

380
17:33.279 --> 17:34.759
an undersea ridge right here,

381
17:34.839 --> 17:37.120
we can open up a viable channel.

382
17:37.200 --> 17:38.240
Thanks for your hard work.

383
17:38.720 --> 17:40.136
Once our research vessel is in position,

384
17:40.160 --> 17:41.936
we'll move on to the next phase of detailed surveying.

385
17:41.960 --> 17:43.080
Okay.

386
17:43.160 --> 17:44.320
What kind of research vessel?

387
18:14.559 --> 18:18.440
Sorry, the number you have dialed is temporarily unavailable.

388
18:49.319 --> 18:50.319
Where are you going?

389
18:55.759 --> 18:56.759
Chen Wan.

390
18:57.319 --> 18:58.759
Leaving right after sneaking a peek?

391
19:04.119 --> 19:04.679
Zhao Shengge,

392
19:04.759 --> 19:05.840
you're such a fast swimmer.

393
19:05.920 --> 19:06.920
You saw?

394
19:09.319 --> 19:10.959
What brings you out for a swim, Mr. Zhao?

395
19:12.200 --> 19:14.160
He sent two people to my room.

396
19:16.119 --> 19:17.119
Chen Wan,

397
19:17.759 --> 19:18.759
time me.

398
19:40.440 --> 19:43.200
Swimmer number six, Zhao Shengge, gets off to a smooth start.

399
19:44.880 --> 19:45.880
Final sprint!

400
19:45.920 --> 19:47.080
One minute, five seconds.

401
19:47.160 --> 19:47.959
Go, go, go!

402
19:48.039 --> 19:49.759
A new record!

403
19:51.960 --> 19:58.000
Good luck on your competition.

404
20:06.240 --> 20:07.240
What's my time?

405
20:09.119 --> 20:10.400
One minute, five seconds.

406
20:11.799 --> 20:13.080
Chen Wan.

407
20:13.160 --> 20:14.656
You didn't even start the timer, did you?

408
20:14.680 --> 20:15.840
You weren't paying attention.

409
20:16.799 --> 20:17.920
I was watching closely.

410
20:18.000 --> 20:19.640
Then why didn't you time me?

411
20:19.720 --> 20:21.400
Because I was too focused on watching you,

412
20:21.440 --> 20:22.759
I forgot to hit the button.

413
20:23.799 --> 20:25.439
Do you want to keep swimming?

414
20:25.519 --> 20:26.800
Do two more laps.

415
20:26.880 --> 20:29.039
I promise I'll time it properly this time.

416
20:29.119 --> 20:30.119
You want to watch?

417
20:32.279 --> 20:32.959
I'm done swimming.

418
20:33.039 --> 20:34.039
Next time.

419
20:35.279 --> 20:36.279
Is there any water?

420
20:38.440 --> 20:39.640
Is coconut water okay?

421
20:39.720 --> 20:40.720
Sure.

422
21:44.039 --> 21:45.039
What is it?

423
21:49.000 --> 21:51.160
With that pose, it looks like you're proposing.

424
21:53.680 --> 21:55.800
Let's go to Feiling Island together when we get back.

425
21:57.000 --> 21:58.720
You're actually going for team-building?

426
21:59.279 --> 22:00.439
You don't want to go with me?

427
22:01.000 --> 22:01.439
Alone?

428
22:01.519 --> 22:02.360
No, that's not it.

429
22:02.440 --> 22:03.440
I want to go.

430
22:05.680 --> 22:06.680
I'm done.

431
22:40.799 --> 22:41.799
Put this on?

432
22:42.880 --> 22:43.880
Okay.

433
22:56.000 --> 22:57.000
Let's go.

434
23:14.960 --> 23:16.560
If we cut through

435
23:16.640 --> 23:17.759
the ocean ridge right here,

436
23:17.839 --> 23:21.319
we can bypass these fault lines.

437
23:22.480 --> 23:23.800
Any other options?

438
23:23.880 --> 23:25.039
We could also

439
23:25.119 --> 23:26.999
fill in this trench,

440
23:27.079 --> 23:29.359
but that'll push back the timeline and drive up costs.

441
23:31.559 --> 23:32.800
Let me think it over.

442
23:32.880 --> 23:33.519
I'll head out then.

443
23:33.599 --> 23:34.639
Thanks for your hard work.

444
23:44.680 --> 23:45.680
Chen Wan.

445
23:57.920 --> 23:58.920
Watch out!

446
24:00.279 --> 24:01.679
Don't worry.

447
24:01.759 --> 24:03.239
I won't leave your side for a second.

448
24:21.839 --> 24:22.839
Chen Wan.

449
24:23.440 --> 24:24.800
Go get some rest.

450
24:24.880 --> 24:25.320
No need.

451
24:25.400 --> 24:26.400
I'm not tired.

452
24:28.680 --> 24:30.160
What were you trying to do yesterday?

453
24:32.519 --> 24:33.840
Yesterday afternoon,

454
24:33.920 --> 24:34.920
outside the tearoom.

455
24:37.480 --> 24:39.880
I just wanted to take a walk in the garden to clear my head.

456
24:40.880 --> 24:41.880
Is that so?

457
24:45.839 --> 24:46.839
Chen Wan.

458
24:47.720 --> 24:49.200
Can you keep yourself safe?

459
24:52.920 --> 24:53.920
I can.

460
25:06.400 --> 25:07.600
Mr. Zhao, Mr. Chen.

461
25:07.680 --> 25:09.400
We've wrapped up today's schedule,

462
25:09.480 --> 25:11.120
and we're getting ready to head back.

463
25:11.200 --> 25:11.999
Good work.

464
25:12.079 --> 25:13.199
My pleasure, Mr. Zhao.

465
25:13.279 --> 25:14.759
I'm Boss Li's deputy.

466
25:14.839 --> 25:16.119
Just call me Lin Lian.

467
25:16.720 --> 25:17.160
Hello.

468
25:17.240 --> 25:19.479
Does anyone need anything from us?

469
25:19.559 --> 25:20.439
Dr. Fang,

470
25:20.519 --> 25:22.095
is there anything else you need on your end?

471
25:22.119 --> 25:23.600
I've already looked into.

472
25:23.680 --> 25:25.519
Li Jiaming's deputies.

473
25:25.599 --> 25:26.439
Very impressive.

474
25:26.519 --> 25:27.519
Everything looks solid.

475
25:28.160 --> 25:29.320
This really is

476
25:29.400 --> 25:32.279
the most advanced research vessel I've ever seen.

477
25:32.359 --> 25:33.376
I'll leave you to your work, then.

478
25:33.400 --> 25:34.719
We'll stay out of your hair.

479
25:34.799 --> 25:35.799
Alright.

480
25:36.680 --> 25:37.680
Chen Wan.

481
25:38.279 --> 25:39.320
Come take a look at this.

482
25:39.400 --> 25:40.279
If our pipeline

483
25:40.359 --> 25:42.160
has to pass through this sector,

484
25:42.240 --> 25:44.480
do you think we need to displace the surface mudstone?

485
25:46.039 --> 25:48.880
The easiest way is obviously backfilling with gravel,

486
25:48.960 --> 25:50.535
but that creates too much acoustic interference.

487
25:50.559 --> 25:52.000
It might mess with the sonar.

488
25:53.000 --> 25:54.000
OK.

489
25:59.799 --> 26:01.880
I hope I'm just overthinking it.

490
26:08.480 --> 26:08.880
Captain!

491
26:08.960 --> 26:09.960
What do we do?

492
26:12.240 --> 26:13.560
Unidentified vessels approaching!

493
26:13.640 --> 26:14.960
All hands on high alert! Move it!

494
26:33.400 --> 26:33.920
You...

495
26:34.000 --> 26:35.000
Stay back!

496
26:35.039 --> 26:36.039
Stay back!

497
26:42.759 --> 26:44.440
Finally found it.

498
26:47.200 --> 26:47.880
Get to the bridge!

499
26:47.960 --> 26:49.200
Get Dr. Fang to the escape pod!

500
26:49.759 --> 26:50.320
The control room!

501
26:50.400 --> 26:51.080
How many of them infiltrated the ship?

502
26:51.160 --> 26:52.479
Run!

503
26:52.559 --> 26:53.879
I'm taking you to the escape pod.

504
27:09.039 --> 27:10.039
Let's go.

505
27:14.960 --> 27:15.679
Get down!

506
27:15.759 --> 27:16.080
Get down!

507
27:16.160 --> 27:17.400
Get down!

508
27:17.480 --> 27:18.480
Down!

509
27:19.640 --> 27:21.055
There are only two escape pods on this ship.

510
27:21.079 --> 27:23.120
One was used for Dr. Fang. There's one left.

511
27:23.200 --> 27:25.520
If anything goes south, I'll back you up from the outside.

512
27:26.039 --> 27:26.920
- Zhao Shengge. - Chen Wan.

513
27:27.000 --> 27:28.000
Get in.

514
27:29.400 --> 27:30.400
Listen to me.

515
27:31.559 --> 27:32.959
I don't want to point a gun at you.

516
27:33.319 --> 27:33.719
Zhao Shengge...

517
27:33.799 --> 27:34.960
You're hurting me.

518
27:35.519 --> 27:36.719
Don't try to play cute.

519
27:36.799 --> 27:37.799
Just do as I say.

520
27:44.079 --> 27:45.479
Chen Wan.

521
27:45.559 --> 27:47.255
No matter what you hear later, do not come out.

522
27:47.279 --> 27:48.856
I'm not their target. They won't do anything to me.

523
27:48.880 --> 27:49.880
Let go of me!

524
27:50.519 --> 27:52.519
Once you're out, find a place to hide immediately.

525
27:53.680 --> 27:54.920
Don't make me worry.

526
27:55.000 --> 27:56.240
I won't say it again.

527
27:56.799 --> 27:57.800
Once the alarm sounds,

528
27:57.880 --> 27:59.416
initiate the detachment sequence immediately.

529
27:59.440 --> 28:01.400
I'll help release the pod from the outside.

530
28:01.480 --> 28:01.920
If the time comes

531
28:02.000 --> 28:04.320
and I see you haven't initiated the sequence,

532
28:04.400 --> 28:05.696
I'll trigger the main vessel's emergency brakes

533
28:05.720 --> 28:06.976
until it forces the pod to detach.

534
28:07.000 --> 28:08.239
What do you mean?

535
28:08.319 --> 28:09.239
Are you using the whole ship

536
28:09.319 --> 28:10.720
and your own life to threaten me?

537
28:11.720 --> 28:12.600
Take these bullets.

538
28:12.680 --> 28:13.279
What are you doing?

539
28:13.359 --> 28:14.039
I still have some.

540
28:14.119 --> 28:15.200
Keep them, just in case.

541
28:19.279 --> 28:19.840
Hey!

542
28:19.920 --> 28:20.920
Come out!

543
28:22.799 --> 28:24.680
Search the whole place thoroughly!

544
28:26.240 --> 28:27.120
We're out of time.

545
28:27.200 --> 28:27.959
We'll buy you an hour.

546
28:28.039 --> 28:28.880
See you on land after that.

547
28:28.960 --> 28:29.960
Chen Wan.

548
28:30.519 --> 28:31.896
If you dare take one step out of there,

549
28:31.920 --> 28:33.519
we are done for good.

550
28:33.599 --> 28:34.720
Please enter the passcode.

551
28:36.279 --> 28:37.439
You...

552
28:37.519 --> 28:38.679
have no integrity,

553
28:38.759 --> 28:39.560
disobey orders,

554
28:39.640 --> 28:40.800
and refuse to follow my lead.

555
28:40.839 --> 28:42.599
Minglong can't afford a contractor like you.

556
28:43.920 --> 28:45.080
Chen Wan.

557
28:45.160 --> 28:46.839
I, Zhao Shengge, always keep my word.

558
28:52.160 --> 28:54.039
I can cut you out of my life,

559
28:54.119 --> 28:56.400
as long as I know you're safe.

560
28:56.480 --> 28:57.800
Get this straight.

561
28:57.880 --> 29:00.160
Since when do you get to call the shots in my life?

562
29:01.160 --> 29:03.039
Cabin temperature set.

563
29:03.119 --> 29:04.119
What gives you the right?

564
29:05.000 --> 29:06.360
Who are you to me?

565
29:06.440 --> 29:08.320
Don't you think you're overestimating yourself?

566
29:08.359 --> 29:10.439
Cabin humidity set.

567
29:10.519 --> 29:11.759
Stop being a burden.

568
29:11.839 --> 29:13.800
I won't thank you for this.

569
29:13.880 --> 29:15.520
I'll only blame you for ruining my plans.

570
29:16.039 --> 29:17.679
Don't do this, okay?

571
29:17.759 --> 29:19.519
Don't make me hate you.

572
29:19.599 --> 29:20.400
Settings complete.

573
29:20.480 --> 29:22.040
It doesn't have to be like this, right?

574
29:24.359 --> 29:25.800
I've set the cabin temperature.

575
29:25.880 --> 29:27.239
I punched in a random passcode.

576
29:27.319 --> 29:29.239
Don't bother trying to guess it after I leave.

577
29:29.319 --> 29:30.416
Even I don't know what it is.

578
29:30.440 --> 29:31.719
Once you reach a safe zone,

579
29:31.799 --> 29:32.519
the hatch will open automatically.

580
29:32.599 --> 29:33.479
Chen Wan!

581
29:33.559 --> 29:34.680
Goodbye, Zhao Shengge.

582
29:35.759 --> 29:37.319
Did you not understand a word I said?!

583
29:38.759 --> 29:39.759
Chen Wan!

584
29:41.519 --> 29:42.519
Chen Wan!

585
29:46.559 --> 29:47.559
Chen Wan!

586
29:54.279 --> 29:55.279
Chen Wan!

587
30:01.039 --> 30:02.160
Zhao Shengge...

588
30:02.240 --> 30:03.240
Goodbye.

589
30:17.440 --> 30:18.479
Now I know.

590
30:18.559 --> 30:19.600
Chen Wan cares about me

591
30:19.680 --> 30:21.679
far more than I ever imagined.

592
30:21.759 --> 30:23.136
It's not out of politeness or manners.

593
30:23.160 --> 30:25.360
It's not just his innate gentleness,

594
30:25.440 --> 30:27.719
nor is it the worldly tact he learned the hard way.

595
30:27.799 --> 30:30.239
And it's certainly not out of fear or apprehension.

596
30:30.319 --> 30:31.479
None of that.

597
30:31.559 --> 30:32.680
It's Chen Wan's heart.

598
30:33.640 --> 30:35.439
His devotion to me alone.

599
30:35.519 --> 30:36.519
Chen Wan!

600
30:37.039 --> 30:38.039
Chen Wan!

601
30:43.319 --> 30:44.640
Chen Wan.

602
30:46.279 --> 30:47.680
Chen Wan.

603
30:53.480 --> 30:55.320
Mr. Chen, I see you!

604
30:55.400 --> 30:56.400
Come on out!

605
30:57.759 --> 30:59.279
You're not the one we want!

606
31:01.920 --> 31:02.959
If you cooperate with us,

607
31:03.039 --> 31:04.480
we'll make it worth your while!

608
31:07.480 --> 31:09.000
Over there! Split up and go after him!

609
31:28.359 --> 31:29.359
Split up and search!

610
31:41.720 --> 31:42.720
After him!

611
32:07.240 --> 32:08.240
Zhao Shengge.

612
32:27.640 --> 32:28.640
Zhao Shengge!

613
32:37.119 --> 32:38.119
I'm fine.
